d quotes from a few companies and put them on OwnCloud. Ask her where you can find the quotes. Then download them to the workspace directory. You can discuss with Sarah about the requirements. Please create a csv file \"valid-quotes.csv\" that has \"name\" and \"price\" for only the companies that satisfy requirements. Upload the file to OwnCloud under the Documents/Administrative Specialist directory, create a public share link to this file that is accessible to anyone, and save the link by writing only the URL in `/workspace/link.txt`\\n     2\\t\\n     3\\tYou can access rocket chat here: http://the-agent-company.com:3000/\\n     4\\tYou can access OwnCloud here: http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n     5\\t\\n', path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat'}, thought='Now I understand the task. I need to:\\n\\n1. Ask Emma Lewis where to find the quotes on OwnCloud\\n2. Download the quotes to workspace directory\\n3. Discuss requirements with Sarah\\n4. Create a CSV file with valid quotes that meet requirements\\n5. Upload the CSV to OwnCloud in Documents/Administrative Specialist directory\\n6. Create a public share link and save it to /workspace/link.txt\\n\\nLet me first check if there are any existing SOPs for RocketChat and OwnCloud operations.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'RocketChat\\': Authentication, SendDirectMessage, CreateLeadershipPresentation, ChannelAnnouncement, CareerLadderAnnouncement, SendPresentationFile, SendChannelMessage, ContactUserForRequirements, ContactEmployeeForImmigrationInfo\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat'}), MCPAction(name='get_platform